 25:5 , compare 25:11 (object נזיר ), Deut 24:21 ; Judg 9:27 (object in both, כרם ); hence Participle active grape-gathering, -gatherer Jer 6:9 ; 49:9 ; Obadiah 5; figurative cut off (= take away) Psalm 76:13 (object נגידים רות ); most often Passive participle cut off, made inaccessible , De Isa 2:15 = fortified , always f.; Generally adjective with ערים עיר, ; Num 13:28 ; Deut 1:28 ; 3:5 ; 9:1 ; Josh 14:12 ; 2Sam 20:6 ; 2Kin 18:13 = Isa 36:1 ; 2Kin 19:25 = Isa 37:26 ; 2Chr 17:2 ; 19:5 ; 32:1 ; 33:14 ; Neh 9:25 ; Isa 25:2 ; 27:10 ; Ezek 36:35 ; Hosea 8:14 ; Zeph 1:16 ; rarely with חומה Deut 28:52 ; Isa 2:15 ; Jer 15:20 ; הב ׳יער Zech 11:2 (read Kt); once, substantive of secrets, mysteries (= unattainable things) Jer 33:3 ; &#8212; ׳ב Ezek 21:25 ᵐ5 Sm Co בְּתוֺכָהּ , doubtless right. Niph`al Imperfect יִבָּצֵר be withheld Gen 11:6 ( מֵהֶם ), Job 42:2 ( מִמְּךָ ). Pi`el Imperfect 3feminine singular תְּבַצֵּר Jer 51:53 fortify ; so Infinitive לְבַּצֵר Isa 22:10 .","rootNote":"a primitive root; to clip off; specifically (as denominative from 1210 )","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 17 2","keyReferences":["2Chr 17 2","2Chr 19 5","2Chr 32 1","2Chr 33 14","2Kgs 18 13","2Kgs 19 25","2Sam 20 6","Deut 1 28"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":38,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 17 2","book":"2Chr","chapter":17,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בְּצֻר֑וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aafpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 19 5","book":"2Chr","chapter":19,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בְּצֻר֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aafpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 1","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בְּצֻר֔וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aafpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 33 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":33,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בְּצֻר֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aafpa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 18 